# JOEF MCPB: frozen 2024 numerical replication driver.
# Numerical core and embedded inputs are unchanged from the received study.
# Base R only for model fitting. No downloads or package installation.
# Run: source(file.choose(), encoding="UTF-8") or Rscript this_file.R
# JOEF_MCPB_MODE: full (default) or check (14 existing functional checks).
# JOEF_MCPB_NO_AUTO=true loads functions without fitting.
# JOEF_MCPB_OUTDIR selects a new, empty numerical-results directory.
# Publication tables and figures: ../build_outputs.py; see README_REPLICATION.md.
# This wrapper deliberately does not invoke the superseded R reporting layer.
# Scientific limits: exploratory data, parent-summary comparisons, no dominance guarantee.

